### Requests for the REST Client (VS Code) / JetBrains HTTP client. Run `make seed` first.
@api = http://localhost:8000

### Authorize (cross-border: merchant charged USD, network bills MXN)
POST {{api}}/v1/authorizations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "network_transaction_id": "ntx_manual_1",
  "card_id": "card_demo",
  "amount": 12000, "currency": "MXN",
  "merchant_amount": 700, "merchant_currency": "USD",
  "mcc": "5812", "merchant_name": "Taqueria El Paso", "merchant_country": "US"
}

### Partial reversal (omit amount for full)
POST {{api}}/v1/authorizations/ntx_manual_1/reversals
Content-Type: application/json

{"event_id": "evt_manual_r1", "amount": 2000}

### Clearing (final; may exceed the hold)
POST {{api}}/v1/authorizations/ntx_manual_1/clearings
Content-Type: application/json

{"event_id": "evt_manual_c1", "amount": 13800}

### Company balances
GET {{api}}/v1/companies/co_demo

### Card + monthly spend
GET {{api}}/v1/cards/card_demo

### Card authorizations
GET {{api}}/v1/cards/card_demo/authorizations

### Freeze / unfreeze / change limits
PATCH {{api}}/v1/cards/card_demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "frozen"}
